    {"target":"Strings/Locations","key":"CommunityCenter_AreaCompletion1","source":"We are the Junimos... Keepers of the forest.","translation":"我們是祝尼魔……森林的守護者。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Locations","key":"CommunityCenter_AreaCompletion2","source":"This house was empty for years... The trees moved in and so did we.","translation":"這棟房子空了好多年……樹木搬了進來，我們也一樣。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Locations","key":"CommunityCenter_AreaCompletion3","source":"We're happy to help... It's not our house, after all.","translation":"我們很樂意幫忙……畢竟這不是我們的房子。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Locations","key":"CommunityCenter_AreaCompletion4","source":"So many wonderful bundles... thank you! Thank you!","translation":"好多美妙的收集包……謝謝！謝謝！"},
    {"target":"Strings/Locations","key":"CommunityCenter_AreaCompletion5","source":"When we're done here, we'll return to the other world.","translation":"完成這裡的工作後，我們會回到另一個世界。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Locations","key":"CommunityCenter_AreaCompletion6","source":"The last bundle... Farewell... {0}.","translation":"最後一個收集包……再見……{0}。"},
